title Real-time chat
direction right

Mobile clients [icon: mobile]
Web clients [icon: browser]

Edge [color: gray] {
  CDN [icon: cloudflare]
  WebSocket gateway [icon: webhook, description: sticky sessions]
}
Chat backend [color: blue] {
  Presence svc [icon: users, description: Go]
  Messaging svc [icon: chat, description: Elixir]
  Rooms svc [icon: layers, description: Node.js]
  Moderation svc [icon: shield, description: Python]
  Media upload svc [icon: upload]
}
Realtime fabric [color: red] {
  Pub/sub [icon: redis, description: Redis Streams]
  Presence cache [icon: redis]
}
Storage [color: purple] {
  Message store [icon: cassandra, shape: cylinder]
  Rooms DB [icon: postgres, shape: cylinder]
  Attachments [icon: bucket]
}
Push [icon: notification]
Search [icon: elasticsearch]
Abuse ML [icon: brain, color: orange]

Mobile clients, Web clients > CDN > WebSocket gateway
WebSocket gateway <> Messaging svc: frames
WebSocket gateway <> Presence svc: heartbeats
Messaging svc > Rooms svc
Messaging svc > Message store
Messaging svc --> Pub/sub: fan-out
Pub/sub --> WebSocket gateway: deliver
Presence svc > Presence cache
Rooms svc > Rooms DB
Messaging svc --> Moderation svc: scan
Moderation svc > Abuse ML
Media upload svc > Attachments
Mobile clients > Media upload svc
Messaging svc --> Push: offline users
Message store --> Search: index
